    "name": "crc32_endpoint_8B",
    "description": "Fabric endpoint CRC32 datapath, 8 byte(s) per cycle, serial next-state form, zlib/Ethernet compatible (reflected polynomial 0xEDB88320), sized for a 10 Gbps link",
